        // Check if the extension is whitelisted.
        if (!STORE.whitelistedExtensions(extension)) {
            revert Errors.GuardPolicy_UnauthorizedExtension(extension);
        }
    }
```

In addition to blocking specific selectors in `_checkTransaction`, restrict arbitrary unapproved selectors on contracts where the Safe holds actively rented assets (or explicitly block `burn` / `permit` / non-standard transfer selectors), and verify in `checkAfterExecution` that the Safe's balances/ownership of all actively rented tokens remain intact after the transaction executes.

