findings.technical_details:
In `ASDRouter.lzCompose` (lines 85–97), the router wraps the incoming whitelisted OFT stablecoin into `asdUSDC` and immediately attempts to swap `amountUSDC` of `asdUSDC` for `$NOTE`:

```solidity
