uint amountUSDC = ASDUSDC(asdUSDC).deposit(_from, amountLD);

/* swap tokens for $NOTE (check minAmount for slippage) */
(uint amountNote, bool successfulSwap) = _swapOFTForNote(asdUSDC, amountUSDC, payload._minAmountASD);
```

Inside `_swapOFTForNote(address _oftAddress, uint _amount, uint _minAmountNote)` (lines 209–255), the contract checks pool existence via `ambientPoolFor`, queries price impact via `ICrocImpact(crocImpactAddress).calcImpact(...)`, and then performs a low-level call to `crocSwapAddress` with selector `ICrocSwapDex.swap.selector`:

```solidity
