In `DolomiteConnector.closeBorrowPosition`, register/update the holding position for sub-account `0` (`abi.encode(uint256(0))`) since collateral is transferred into sub-account `0`, and only remove the holding position for `accountId` if it has no remaining markets with balances in Dolomite:

```solidity
