In `YieldStakingBase._repay`, if `sd.debtShare == totalDebtShare`, set `vars.nftDebt` directly to `getTotalDebt(poolId)` so that the last staker settles the exact remaining debt in the pool; otherwise, round up when converting `sd.debtShare` to debt assets during repayment so exiting positions do not leave unpaid rounding dust behind.

