Store the `soulBounded` status immutably per `tokenId` within `PhiNFT1155` when the art token is created in `createArtFromFactory` (or prohibit changing `soulBounded` in `PhiFactory.updateArtSettings`), and check the local immutable mapping in `safeTransferFrom` and `soulBounded(tokenId_)`.

```solidity
    mapping(uint256 tokenId => bool isSoulBounded) private _tokenIdSoulBounded;

    function soulBounded(uint256 tokenId_) public view returns (bool) {
        return _tokenIdSoulBounded[tokenId_];
    }

    function safeTransferFrom(
