In `Float128.add`, `Float128.sub`, and `Float128.toPackedFloat`, ensure that 38-digit and 72-digit mantissas are properly scaled according to `MAXIMUM_EXPONENT` and that `MANTISSA_L_FLAG_MASK` is always set whenever the final mantissa is 72 digits:

