1. `mantissaMultiplier = digitsMantissa - 38` is positive (`1` to `33`).
2. At line 1102, `isResultL` only checks `slt(MAXIMUM_EXPONENT, add(exponent, mantissaMultiplier))` (i.e., `exponent + digitsMantissa - 38 > -18`), failing to check whether `digitsMantissa > MAX_DIGITS_M`.
